# Sophix admin CRM — local Vite (npm run dev)
#
# 1) Start the API on port 5000, e.g.:
#    cd ../sophix-backend && npm start
#
# 2) Leave VITE_API_URL unset so the browser uses relative "/api" and Vite
#    proxies to the backend (see vite.config.ts). If you set VITE_API_URL to
#    an absolute URL, requests bypass the proxy and you need CORS + a reachable host.
#
# 3) If the proxy cannot connect (ECONNREFUSED), try localhost instead of 127.0.0.1:
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:5000
#
# Or if the API runs on another host/port:
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:5001
